# Client env. Copy to .env for local development.
#
# For production set these in your host's BUILD settings (Vercel:
# Settings -> Environment Variables), NOT as runtime variables - Vite
# inlines them into the bundle at build time, so changing them requires
# a rebuild.
#
# Local backend:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
VITE_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8000
#
# Production backend (Render) - replace with your real Render hostname:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://watch-party-api.onrender.com
#   VITE_WS_URL=wss://watch-party-api.onrender.com
#
# Rules:
#   - API uses https, WS uses wss (never mixed, or the browser blocks it)
#   - No trailing slash on either
#   - The hostname must match ALLOWED_ORIGINS on the backend exactly,
#     otherwise the WebSocket is rejected at the Origin check.
#
# To find your Render hostname:
#   Render dashboard -> your service -> Settings -> Public URL